2. FDA drug labels and FDA web pages (public domain)
   Files: app/data/label_changes.json (sentences from DailyMed SPL label
          versions), app/data/fda_food.json (sentences from FDA consumer pages:
          "Grapefruit Juice and Some Drugs Don't Mix" and "Drug Interactions:
          What You Should Know"), app/tests/fixtures/*_openfda.json,
          core/fixtures/*.json, datapipe/tests/fixtures/*.json
   Source: U.S. Food and Drug Administration, via openFDA (https://open.fda.gov)
           and DailyMed (https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov). Works of the U.S.
           federal government are in the public domain in the United States.
           Source URLs and dates are kept in each file.
   PillProof is not endorsed by the FDA or the NLM.

